<title>HONG KONG: Shareholder cuts stake in Theme.</title>
<headline>Shareholder cuts stake in Theme.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Theme International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday one of its major shareholders, Chiu Ka Lun, had reduced his stake in the company by 13 million shares, or 2.65 percent of the issued share capital.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Theme's chairman Lai Ngan Long controlled 45.8 percent of Theme as in February 1996 and Chiu held 20.9 percent.</p>
<p>Shares of the fashion retailer were unchanged at HK$2.75 per share at midday with 3.01 million shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
